  // Daily quests. The master prompt (3.4): "5 daily quests plus a daily chest" in the daily loop; the welcome chest at the
  // end of the tutorial unlocks them (9.4). Ours: the pool, the targets, the rewards and the chest. Every day (00:00 UTC)
  // brings "count" quests from the pool for the Castle's level ("castle"; "needs" a building); a quest's "target" goes by
  // the Castle's level ([from level, amount]); a done quest is claimed for its reward, and claiming all of them opens the
  // chest (its relic rarity by the Castle's level). Unfinished quests can be swapped "rerolls" times a day. Gems: about
  // 20 a day from quests and the chest, half of the free player's target of 40 (8.6). Collect targets are about three
  // hours of the mines' (farms') production at that Castle. Events: win, threeStars (battles won), raid (attacks on
  // world lands), collectGold, collectFood, train (squads queued), upgrade (buildings, lands, troops and spells started),
  // craft (spells queued), stones (portal stones spent), site (Titan Monuments and XP Arenas), mission (campaigns).
  "dailyQuests": {
    "count": 5,
    "rerolls": 2,
    "chest": { "gems": 10, "stones": 6, "relic": [[3, 1], [12, 2]] },
    "pool": [
      { "id": "q_win",     "event": "win",         "name": "Победите в битвах: {n}",              "target": [[1, 2], [6, 3], [12, 4]], "reward": { "gems": 2, "stones": 3 } },
